        <div
          class="
            comment__body
            text-styles
            text-styles--secondary
            body
            
            
          ">
          <p>This journey matches what I see with many automation systems: visual workflows are great for discovering the process, but production eventually wants versioning, tests, review, and clearer ownership. The key is not treating the rewrite as a failure of n8n, but as a sign that the workflow found real business value.</p>


